WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.787
The numbers.

00:00:01.737 --> 00:00:05.825
46 MPs still serving who voted both bills.

00:00:05.825 --> 00:00:10.562
76,707 cumulative MAID deaths.

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:16.337
5.1 percent of all Canadian deaths in 2024 — one in twenty.

00:00:16.337 --> 00:00:23.000
The UN Committee on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities has called for Track 2 to be repealed entirely.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.750
10 provinces oppose the mental illness expansion.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.350
Zero of these MPs have faced accountability.
